The '''Northern Polar Command Sector''', also known as simply the '''Northern PCS''', was located in the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star's]] apex region, and held the combat leadership for the [[space station]]. The Northern PCS was predominantly responsible for the command operations of the [[Death Star]], and was where daily administrative work was carried out. As such, the Northern PCS was outfitted with various audience halls, briefing rooms, wardrooms, and other essential command areas. Such include the [[Emperor's tower]], which contained the [[Emperor's throne room (Death Star)|Emperor's throne room]]; the [[Overbridge (Death Star I)|overbridge]] was also found in that area.<ref name="Dawn" /> The Northern Polar Command Center, along with the rest of the Death Star, was destroyed during the [[Battle of Yavin]] by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]].<ref name="Episode IV" />

